function CircleArc:SetParmas( dirDegree_, swingLen_, axis_, curvature_ ) 

    local dir = IdolLive3D_Utils.Angle2Dir( dirDegree_, Vector3.up, Vector3.back ) -- Vector3

    self.axis = axis_ -- 曲线绕着哪个轴旋转;
    local midPos = Vector3.zero
    local a_to_b = dir.normalized
    self.swingLen = swingLen_
    local halfLen = swingLen_ * 0.5
    

    self.curvature = Mathf.Clamp(curvature_, -1.0, 1.0) -- [-0.1, 0.1]:直线, [-1,-0.1]: AB 左侧弧线, [0.1,1]: AB 右侧弧线
    self.isCurve = true
    self.circleCenterPos = Vector3.zero
    self.circleRadius = 0

    if self.curvature >= -0.1 and self.curvature <= 0.1 then 
        self.isCurve = false 
        -- 两端点 pos:
        self.aPos = -dir * halfLen
        self.bPos =  dir * halfLen

    elseif self.curvature < 0.0 then 
        local t = Mathf.Clamp01(KTool.Remap( -0.1, -1, 0, 1, self.curvature ))
        local move = (Quaternion.AngleAxis(-90, self.axis) * a_to_b) * halfLen
        local minPos = midPos + move
        local maxPos = midPos + move * 3
        self.circleCenterPos = Vector3.Lerp( maxPos, minPos, t )
        

        local OM = midPos - self.circleCenterPos
        self.circleRadius = OM.magnitude

        self.OA = Quaternion.AngleAxis( Mathf.Rad2Deg * halfLen / self.circleRadius, self.axis) * OM
    else
        local t = Mathf.Clamp01(KTool.Remap( 0.1, 1, 0, 1, self.curvature ))
        local move = (Quaternion.AngleAxis(90, self.axis) * a_to_b) * halfLen
        local minPos = midPos + move
        local maxPos = midPos + move * 3
        self.circleCenterPos = Vector3.Lerp( maxPos, minPos, t )

        local OM = midPos - self.circleCenterPos
        self.circleRadius = OM.magnitude

        self.OA = Quaternion.AngleAxis( Mathf.Rad2Deg * -halfLen / self.circleRadius, self.axis) * OM
    end

    self.isInit = true
end 



---@param t_ number @ [0.0,1.0] lerp weight
---@return UnityEngine.Vector3
function CircleArc:GetPos( t_ ) 
    if self.isInit ~= true then
        printError("代码调用不当, 本实例尚未初始化") 
        return Vector3.zero
    end 
    ---
    t_ = Mathf.Clamp01(t_)
    if self.isCurve == false then 
        return Vector3.Lerp( self.aPos, self.bPos, t_ )
    end 

    if self.curvature < 0.0 then -- AB 左侧的弧线
        return self.circleCenterPos + Quaternion.AngleAxis( Mathf.Rad2Deg * -self.swingLen * t_ / self.circleRadius, self.axis) * self.OA
    else  -- AB 右侧的弧线
        return self.circleCenterPos + Quaternion.AngleAxis( Mathf.Rad2Deg * self.swingLen * t_ / self.circleRadius, self.axis) * self.OA
    end 
end







return CircleArc
